---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: 作品與 Agent Skills
permalink: /works/
description: FW 公開分享的 Agent Skills、實作專案與開發工具，可直接前往 GitHub、安裝使用或閱讀設計文章。
---

<header class="mb-12">
  <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">作品與 Agent Skills</h1>
  <p class="text-xl text-gray-600">這裡收錄從真實工作抽出的 Skill、專案與工具。每個項目都提供可以直接使用或檢查原始碼的入口。</p>
</header>

<div class="space-y-12">
{% for category in works.categories %}
  {% set categoryWorks = works.items | filterByCategory(category.id) %}
  {% if categoryWorks.length > 0 %}
  <section aria-labelledby="works-{{ category.id }}">
    <div class="mb-6">
      <h2 id="works-{{ category.id }}" class="text-3xl font-bold">{{ category.title }}</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600">{{ category.description }}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-6">
    {% for work in categoryWorks %}
      {% set workCategoryLabel = category.title %}
      {% include "components/work-card.njk" %}
    {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %}
</div>
